spans.s:
उच्-छ्रित, अस्, आ, अम्, raised, lifted up; high, tall;
advancing, increasing, prosperous; born, produced;
increased in size or bulk, grown.
—उच्छ्रित-पाणि,
इस्, इस्, इ, with outstretched hand.

उच्-छ्रिति, इस्, f. rising upwards, elevation, increase;
the upright side of a triangle; the upright elevation
or height of a figure.

उच्-छ्वासिन्, ई, इनी, इ, breathing, inhaling air;
sighing, breathing out, expiring; pausing; rising,
coming forward.
